{
  "slug": "lambda-api-plugin",
  "name": "Lambda Api Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A toolkit for building AWS API Gateway + Lambda server APIs. Provides end-to-end skill coverage from Lambda handler development and test writing to code quality enforcement.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **5 agents** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `api-tester` (Guide for writing unit and integration tests for Lambda handlers in this project using Vitest and Testcontainers), `aws-cdk-development` (AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) expert for building cloud infrastructure with TypeScript/Python), `drizzle-developer` (Guide for using Drizzle ORM and Drizzle Kit in this project), `lambda-api-developer` (Guide for developing AWS Lambda API handlers in this project), `lint-rule-development` (Step-by-step guide for creating and implementing lint rules in Biome's analyzer), `typescript-expert` (TypeScript and JavaScript expert with deep knowledge of type-level programming, performance optimization, monorepo management, migration strategies, and modern…)\n- **Agents** (5): `biome-check` (Use this agent to lint and format code using Biome), `generate-lambda` (Use this agent to generate a new AWS Lambda handler with index.ts and schema.ts), `run-tests` (Use this agent to run the project's test suite), `setup-project` (Use this agent to initialize a new AWS API Gateway + Lambda project from scratch), `write-tests` (Use this agent to write unit tests and integration tests for Lambda handlers in this project)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SubagentStart`, `SubagentStop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lambda-api-plugin@claude-community` from `hu-shukang/lambda-api-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
